'''Secluded Cavy Island''' (隠されしモルモ島 ''Kakusareshi Morumotō'', '''Hidden Island of Morumo''') is the 13th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 111th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]] and is available up to {{2c}} difficulty. This sub-chapter focuses on [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]], [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] and [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] enemies, except in [[Pollution Isolation|stage 3]], which has no Aliens.

==Difficulty==
Similar to the previous sub-chapters, this sub-chapter isn't very difficult, with the only challenging stage being the last one.
{{LegendDiff|120}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 1 new enemy:
*[[Techn-Old Hyena]]: A [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of [[H. Nah]] with high health, slightly longer range, a guaranteed chance to warp cats back by 1,200 range for 16.67 seconds, [[Counter-Surge]], immunity to curse, and Omni Strikes that extend his maximum range to 390. Like [[Red EnerG]], he gets knocked back up to 3 times.

